Optimal Solution - Compute the sum of absolute ASCII differences between every pair of adjacent characters using a single linear traversal.

class Solution {
    public int scoreOfString(String s) {
        int sum = 0;  // Variable to store the final score
        // Loop through string till second last character
        // because we compare current character with next character
        for (int i = 0; i < s.length() - 1; i++) {
            // Get ASCII value of current character
            int first = s.charAt(i);
            // Get ASCII value of next character
            int second = s.charAt(i + 1);
            // Add absolute difference of ASCII values to sum
            sum += Math.abs(first - second);
        }
        // Return the final computed score
        return sum; 
    }
}

Time Complexity :- O(N).
Space Complexity :- O(1).
